@page "/"

<PageTitle>Smart-X Gateway Console</PageTitle>

<h1>Smart-X IoT Mesh Ecosystem</h1>
<p class="subtitle">
    Hybrid IoT gateway for hydroponic farms, utility trackers, and smart grid installations.
    Choose a pillar to begin.
</p>

<div class="pillar-grid">
    <a href="/sensors" class="pillar-card pillar-active">
        <div class="pillar-icon">📡</div>
        <h2>Sensor Data Ingestion &amp; Telemetry</h2>
        <p>Register devices, attach configuration files or photos, and stream live telemetry into the gateway.</p>
        <span class="pillar-status status-active">Available — Part 1</span>
    </a>

    <div class="pillar-card pillar-disabled">
        <div class="pillar-icon">🔁</div>
        <h2>Real-Time Command Stream &amp; History</h2>
        <p>Send commands back down to devices and browse full telemetry history.</p>
        <span class="pillar-status status-disabled">Coming in Part 2</span>
    </div>

    <div class="pillar-card pillar-disabled">
        <div class="pillar-icon">🕸️</div>
        <h2>Network Topology &amp; Mesh Routing</h2>
        <p>Visualise how devices are physically distributed across zones and facilities.</p>
        <span class="pillar-status status-disabled">Coming in the final PoE</span>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="pillar-card pillar-active" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">
    <div class="pillar-icon">📊</div>
    <h2>Telemetry Dashboard</h2>
    <p>Watch live readings arrive in real time, and see the Anomaly Heartbeat engagement widget react to spikes and drop-offs.</p>
    <a href="/dashboard" class="cta-button">Open Dashboard →</a>
</div>
